%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: NatsukiThrowsHandsWithABears
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179658
    - rid: 4351268260154179659
    - rid: 4351268260154179660
    - rid: 4351268260154179662
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Alright, so Farkas said that the bear was seen down in Falkreath...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179663
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (So I guess I'll be taking a right here.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179664
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179665
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Oh...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179666
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (This part of Skyrim's actually pretty nice!)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179667
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Flowing rivers... warm breezes... nice forest smells!)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179668
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Based on the map I got from Vilkas before leaving, I guess this place
      <i>is</i> closer to the equator...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179669
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (So I guess that makes sense.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179670
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: As she's walking, someone bumps into Natsuki.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179671
    - rid: 4351268260154179672
    - rid: 4351268260154179673
    - rid: 4351268260154179684
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Hey, watch where you're going-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179674
    - rid: 4351268260154179676
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Oh crap, this guy's huge!)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179682
    - rid: 4351268260154179683
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (How did I not see him walking toward me?!?)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0b2f39e4bb91124a867021155fb2ecd, type: 2}
    dialog: Excuse me, little girl, why are you wandering Skyrim alone? Don't you
      know that's dangerous?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179685
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Hey, I'll have you know I'm a member of the Companions!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm on my way to go take care of a bear for them, thank you very much.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179686
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0b2f39e4bb91124a867021155fb2ecd, type: 2}
    dialog: You? Take on a bear?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0b2f39e4bb91124a867021155fb2ecd, type: 2}
    dialog: You're not ready for that yet. Your potential is still stagnant.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179687
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: What's that supposed to mean?!? I've fought a bunch of draugr at once,
      what's a bear to that, huh?!?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179688
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0b2f39e4bb91124a867021155fb2ecd, type: 2}
    dialog: You fought those draugr with help, here you are truly alone.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: ... how would you know about that...?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179689
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0b2f39e4bb91124a867021155fb2ecd, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0b2f39e4bb91124a867021155fb2ecd, type: 2}
    dialog: Obviously, because you are too scrawny to have accomplished such a feat-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179690
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0b2f39e4bb91124a867021155fb2ecd, type: 2}
    dialog: You would require powerful magical equipment to do something like that
      with your current strength.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: And how do you know my equipment isn't magical?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179691
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0b2f39e4bb91124a867021155fb2ecd, type: 2}
    dialog: Because the descriptions don't-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0b2f39e4bb91124a867021155fb2ecd, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179692
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0b2f39e4bb91124a867021155fb2ecd, type: 2}
    dialog: Because, they do not radiate energy like an enchanted weapon should.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179693
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0b2f39e4bb91124a867021155fb2ecd, type: 2}
    dialog: '... here:'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The Ebony-armored man hands Natsuki a strange looking gem.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0b2f39e4bb91124a867021155fb2ecd, type: 2}
    dialog: This should help you on your travels. Take care.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Whatever.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179694
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Natsuki resumes her journey down the road to Falkreath.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179695
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0b2f39e4bb91124a867021155fb2ecd, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179696
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179697
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179698
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179699
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0b2f39e4bb91124a867021155fb2ecd, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0b2f39e4bb91124a867021155fb2ecd, type: 2}
    dialog: Sorry for interrupting again.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0b2f39e4bb91124a867021155fb2ecd, type: 2}
    dialog: If you were wondering what I gave Natsuki, it was a Grand Soul Gem.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0b2f39e4bb91124a867021155fb2ecd, type: 2}
    dialog: Hopefully, you'll know what to do with it when the time comes.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0b2f39e4bb91124a867021155fb2ecd, type: 2}
    dialog: Best of luck...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179700
    - rid: 4351268260154179701
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179702
    - rid: 4351268260154179703
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Natsuki has safely arrived to Falkreath.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179704
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Okay, now that I'm here... where's the bear?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179705
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Farkas said it was nearby...)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Maybe one of the guards would know?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179707
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Natsuki flags down a nearby guard who seems to just be patrolling the
      streets.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Hey, I've been sent by the Companions looking for a bear around here,
      do you know where it would be?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179708
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 308d62972f3bcf945b9d9cd147348a86, type: 2}
    dialog: A nearby bear, eh?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 308d62972f3bcf945b9d9cd147348a86, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, there's plenty down here-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179709
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 308d62972f3bcf945b9d9cd147348a86, type: 2}
    dialog: But, some hunters have tracked a problematic bear down to a den near
      the border crossing with Cyrodiil.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Do you mind showing me about where that is on my map?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179710
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 308d62972f3bcf945b9d9cd147348a86, type: 2}
    dialog: 'Sure. '
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179711
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The guard points toward about where the hunter said the bear den is.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 308d62972f3bcf945b9d9cd147348a86, type: 2}
    dialog: Be careful, I shouldn't need to tell you that bears <i>really</i> don't
      like it when you intrude on their den.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah, yeah. Thanks for the help.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179713
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Natsuki takes a few seconds to triangulate the direction she should be
      walking based on a few local landmarks, and starts walking toward the bear
      den.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179712
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179714
    - rid: 4351268260154179715
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Alright, this looks about right, based on what the guard told me.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179716
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Now, to take on this bear-)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: From the den emerges two bears.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179717
    - rid: 4351268260154179718
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Okay... I might've been bluffing a little when it comes to fighting
      a bear...)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (But two?!?)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The bears don't give Natsuki the time to meaningfully regret her actions,
      as they rush her down.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179720
    - rid: 4351268279254515728
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179719
    - rid: 4351268260154179739
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (How much more can these bears take?!?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179740
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (I probably should've brought one the whelps along for this...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179741
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: ...!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179742
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The brief reprieve Natsuki had is now over; the bears once more charge
      at Natsuki, eager to defend their territory.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179743
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions: []
