    - rid: 4351268260154179697
      type: {class: Conditional_Screen_Overrider, ns: RenCSharp.Sequences, asm: Sequences}
      data:
        possibleScreens:
        - conditions:
          - flagToCheck: WeirdRoute
            operation: 0
            desiredValue: 0
            persistent: 0
            bitWise: 0
          resultingScreen:
            speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0b2f39e4bb91124a867021155fb2ecd, type: 2}
            dialog: You need to start reining them in.
            ScreenActions: []
        - conditions:
          - flagToCheck: WeirdRoute
            operation: 0
            desiredValue: 3
            persistent: 0
            bitWise: 0
          resultingScreen:
            speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0b2f39e4bb91124a867021155fb2ecd, type: 2}
            dialog: You've been doing a good job so far.
            ScreenActions: []
        - conditions:
          - flagToCheck: WeirdRoute
            operation: 1
            desiredValue: 0
            persistent: 0
            bitWise: 0
          resultingScreen:
            speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0b2f39e4bb91124a867021155fb2ecd, type: 2}
            dialog: You need to rein them in more.
            ScreenActions: []
    - rid: 4351268260154179698
      type: {class: Conditional_Screen_Overrider, ns: RenCSharp.Sequences, asm: Sequences}
      data:
        possibleScreens:
        - conditions:
          - flagToCheck: WeirdRoute
            operation: 0
            desiredValue: 0
            persistent: 0
            bitWise: 0
          resultingScreen:
            speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0b2f39e4bb91124a867021155fb2ecd, type: 2}
            dialog: This world is just as harsh as it always is. Not even {mc} is
              really ready for it, and he has the advantage of Thu'um.
            ScreenActions: []
        - conditions:
          - flagToCheck: WeirdRoute
            operation: 0
            desiredValue: 3
            persistent: 0
            bitWise: 0
          resultingScreen:
            speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0b2f39e4bb91124a867021155fb2ecd, type: 2}
            dialog: You need to keep reining them in; I've returned your influence
              over them on purpose.
            ScreenActions: []
        - conditions:
          - flagToCheck: WeirdRoute
            operation: 1
            desiredValue: 0
            persistent: 0
            bitWise: 0
          resultingScreen:
            speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0b2f39e4bb91124a867021155fb2ecd, type: 2}
            dialog: You've seen how they can falter without your guidance.
            ScreenActions: []
    - rid: 4351268260154179699
      type: {class: Conditional_Screen_Overrider, ns: RenCSharp.Sequences, asm: Sequences}
      data:
        possibleScreens:
        - conditions:
          - flagToCheck: WeirdRoute
            operation: 0
            desiredValue: 0
            persistent: 0
            bitWise: 0
          resultingScreen:
            speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0b2f39e4bb91124a867021155fb2ecd, type: 2}
            dialog: 'I implore you: take matters into your own hands. You''ll just
              be making your experience more difficult otherwise.'
            ScreenActions: []
        - conditions:
          - flagToCheck: WeirdRoute
            operation: 0
            desiredValue: 3
            persistent: 0
            bitWise: 0
          resultingScreen:
            speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0b2f39e4bb91124a867021155fb2ecd, type: 2}
            dialog: After all, this story is for you and your satisfaction. And I
              know you don't want to see harm come to them...
            ScreenActions: []
        - conditions:
          - flagToCheck: WeirdRoute
            operation: 1
            desiredValue: 0
            persistent: 0
            bitWise: 0
          resultingScreen:
            speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0b2f39e4bb91124a867021155fb2ecd, type: 2}
            dialog: So I implore you, take matters into your own hands. You know
              they aren't ready yet, after all...
            ScreenActions: []
